         "marks": [],
         "type": "text",
         "text": "A parcel of mass 2.0 kg is released from rest at the top of a delivery chute. The chute is 5.0 m long and its top is 1.5 m vertically above its bottom. The parcel reaches the bottom of the chute with a speed of 4.0 m s⁻¹."
